    "These cores were collected to attempt dating submarine slope failure features based on the contact between failed sediments and overlying post-failure sedimentation, and to establish an undisturbed stratigraphic record for inner Frobisher Bay. This information will be part of a larger project on submarine slope failures and the seabed history of inner Frobisher Bay."
